abstract: "An interactive evidence map for the Evolutionary Stress Framework (ESF): 50 sources organized across 6 evidence layers, mapped to 14 ESF claims and 13 cross-cutting tags, showing how findings from stress physiology, predictive processing, network medicine, developmental science, ecology, and neurodiversity scholarship relate to the framework's core claims."
